<title>HONG KONG: Morgan Stanley launches warrants on Jardine group.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley launches warrants on Jardine group.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley (Jersey) Ltd said it had launched 706 million American-style call warrants on a basket of Jardine group stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p> Hong Kong Land Holdings Ltd	  0.06 shares</p>
<p> Jardine Matheson Holdings Ltd	0.02 shares</p>
<p> Jardine Strategic Holdings Ltd     0.03 shares</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 US$0.3848	PREMIUM	    12.25 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.0737	GEARING	    4.5x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   11.JUN.98	MIN EXER LOT     100,000</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     US$0.4276	SETTLEMENT DATE  27.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     07.JUL.97</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
